   <dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A concurring opinion in FLYING T RANCH v. STILLAGUAMISH TRIBE, October 9, 2025, from the Supreme Court of the State of Washington criticized the 'racism' of foundational cases in 'federal Indian law'.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:description>
